## 7. Action Plan for a Complete Beginner
```markdown
Day 1: Create a free Loom account. Create Stripe account and first payment link ($500).
Day 2: Identify 25 local service businesses with weak websites.
Day 3: Send 25 Spear Emails using the exact template.
Day 4: When you get replies, record personalized Looms for each.
Day 5: Send the Stripe payment link with the Loom. Close your first client.
```

